  {
   "id": "uncertainty",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2750,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### Uncertainty<br><br>- Concentration is a proxy for exposure<br>- Dropout undercounts side effects<br>- Mechanism knowledge is not clinical evidence"
  },
  {
   "id": "hypothesis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 2750,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### Open questions<br><br>- How much variability in exposure comes from adherence versus metabolism?<br>- How do downstream adaptations change a drug's effect over time?<br>- What determines an individual's time to steady state beyond half-life?"
  },
  {
